+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1 Context
+
+- **Project:** TodoMVC vanilla JavaScript implementation
+- **Stack:** Plain JS, no preprocessors, localStorage persistence
+- **Spec source:** `assets/app-spec.md` (TodoMVC spec), `assets/app-template.index.html` (base markup)
+- **Specs written:** 7 feature files, 32 scenarios total
+- **Watchbill:** 7 watches, ordered by dependency (persistence -> add -> toggle -> edit -> clear -> route -> visibility)
+- **Next role:** QM dispatches against the watchbill, discovers undefined steps, then dispatches Crew per failing target
+
+## Decisions
+
+- **Storage key:** `todos-vanillajs` per TodoMVC spec convention
+- **Routing:** Hash-based (`#/`, `#/active`, `#/completed`) per spec
+- **No framework:** Vanilla JS, components split into `js/app.js` following spec directory structure
+- **No perturbation planted:** Greenfield app, no existing production code to perturb
