@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@
+Feature: Adding todos
+  As a user
+  I want to enter new todo items
+  So that I can track tasks I need to complete
+
+  Background:
+    Given the todo app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: New todo input is focused on page load
+    Then the new todo input should be focused
+
+  Scenario: Adding a todo by pressing Enter
+    When the user types "Buy groceries" in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    Then the todo list should contain 1 item
+    And the todo "Buy groceries" should be visible in the list
+    And the new todo input should be empty
+
+  Scenario: Adding a todo trims whitespace
+    When the user types "  Buy groceries  " in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" should be visible in the list
+
+  Scenario: Empty input does not create a todo
+    When the user types "" in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    Then the todo list should contain 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only input does not create a todo
+    When the user types "   " in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    Then the todo list should contain 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Adding multiple todos
+    When the user types "First todo" in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    And the user types "Second todo" in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    Then the todo list should contain 2 items
+    And the todo "First todo" should be visible in the list
+    And the todo "Second todo" should be visible in the list
