@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+Feature: Clearing completed todos
+  As a user
+  I want to remove all completed todos at once
+  So that I can keep my list clean
+
+  Background:
+    Given the todo app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes completed todos
+    And the user has added a todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    And the user has added a todo "Read a book"
+    And the todo "Buy groceries" is completed
+    And the todo "Read a book" is completed
+    When the user clicks "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo list should contain 1 item
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" should be visible in the list
+    And the todo "Buy groceries" should not be visible in the list
+    And the todo "Read a book" should not be visible in the list
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button hidden when no completed todos
+    And the user has added a todo "Buy groceries"
+    Then the "Clear completed" button should be hidden
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button visible when completed todos exist
+    And the user has added a todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the todo "Buy groceries" is completed
+    Then the "Clear completed" button should be visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed updates toggle-all checkbox
+    And the user has added a todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk the dog"
+    And all todos are completed
+    When the user clicks "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo list should contain 0 items
+    And the toggle-all checkbox should be unchecked
diff --git a/features/editing-todos.feature b/features/editing-todos.feature
